# PROJECT.md：项目入口说明，按维护者"大赛材料不入库"的决定**刻意不跟踪**。
# 它此前就未入库；本轮曾误删这条规则，于是它又变成"未跟踪的新文件"（git status 出现 ?? PROJECT.md）。
PROJECT.md

# ---------- 构建产物 ----------
# ---------- Build outputs ----------
build/
dist/
out/
frontend/bin/
frontend/obj/
# 跨平台前端（Avalonia）同样是 .NET 工程，bin/obj 必须忽略：
# The cross-platform front end (Avalonia) is a .NET project too, so bin/obj must be ignored:
# 除了体积，obj 下的 PublishOutputs.*.txt 会记录**打包机的绝对路径**，
# Besides the size, obj\PublishOutputs.*.txt records the **packaging machine's absolute paths**,
# 被 tools\check_feedback.ps1 的"个人绝对路径残留"检查判为不合格（实测踩到过）。
# which tools\check_feedback.ps1 fails as a leftover personal path (hit in practice).
frontend-avalonia/**/bin/
frontend-avalonia/**/obj/
publish/
*.pdb

# ---------- Python ----------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
backend_crash.log

# ---------- 模型与缓存（体积过大，不入库） ----------
# ---------- Models and caches (too large to be committed) ----------
*.gguf
models/*.gguf
.cache/
backend/.cache/

# ---------- 运行时用户数据（后端在工作目录里生成的文件） ----------
# ---------- Runtime user data (files the backend creates in the working directory) ----------
session.json
config.user.json
# 配置示例是**生成物**（tools/gen_config_example.py 由 backend/config.json 生成，
# 内含双语说明与三平台路径对照），权威位置是发布目录里那一份，不入库。
# The configuration example is generated (tools/gen_config_example.py builds it from
# backend/config.json with the bilingual notes); the release tree holds the authoritative
# copy, so the repository does not track one.
config.example.json
ui_state.json
snippets.json
# 超大文件正文的落盘目录（backend 的 files.disk_threshold_chars 触发时写入）。
# The on-disk store for oversized file bodies (written when backend's files.disk_threshold_chars triggers).
# 它是**运行时产物**，且正文随时可由原文件重新解析；内容含用户文档原文，绝不入库。
# It is a runtime artifact whose text can always be re-parsed from the originals, and it holds user document text, so it must never be committed.
file_cache/
# 模型市场的**远端响应缓存**（cache/model_hub/<repo>.json，单个可达数 MB）。
# 纯运行时产物、可随时重新拉取，绝不入库；不加这条则跑一次模型市场门禁就会在
# 仓库根留下一个未跟踪的大文件（实测踩到：跑 `--probe market` 之后出现 ?? cache/）。
# The model-market response cache (cache/model_hub/<repo>.json, several MB each).
# Purely a runtime artifact that can always be re-fetched, so it must never be committed.
cache/
backend_crash.log
# 前端崩溃日志（v0.2.0 修复一：全局异常兜底会写这个文件）
# Front end crash log (v0.2.0 fix one: the global exception fallback writes this file)
frontend_crash.log
# 自动化
# Automation
automation_log.jsonl
automation_processed.json
automation_results/
browser_state.json
# 自动化的持久化浏览器数据目录（v0.2.1 自动化优化 任务一：登录态存在这里）。
# The persisted browser data directory used by automation (v0.2.1 automation task one: sign-in state lives here).
# 它可能出现在仓库根（开发时程序根目录就是仓库根），含 Cookie，绝不能入库。
# It can sit at the repository root (during development the program root is the repository root) and holds cookies, so it must never be committed.
browser_profile/
# 「用调试模式启动浏览器」（任务十七 / 自测问题修复-1）代启动的调试实例所用的数据目录。
# The data directory used by the debug instance that "launch browser in debug mode" (task seventeen / self-test fixes) starts.
# 它与上面那个同理：落在仓库根、含 Cookie，绝不能入库。
# Same reasoning as the entry above: it lands at the repository root and holds cookies, so it must never be committed.
browser_profile_debug/
# 结果目录（新增三；默认生成在程序根目录，也可能被指到仓库内）
# Results directory (added in fix three; created in the program root by default, but may also be pointed inside the repository)
# v0.2.1 发布任务书「全局要求一」：目录名由「批量处理结果」改为英文 results，
# v0.2.1 release brief, global requirement one: the directory name changed from 批量处理结果 to the English results,
# 只锚定仓库根，避免误伤将来任何名为 results 的子目录；旧名保留一行兼容旧用户。
# anchored to the repository root so that no future subdirectory named results is caught by accident; the old name stays for existing users.
批量处理结果/
/results/
