# Skill marketplace
market_cache.json
skills_registry.json
# 已安装技能目录（运行时）：必须写全路径。只写 skills/ 会连
# Installed skills directory (runtime): the full path is required. A bare skills/ would also
# examples/skills/（示例插件，需要入库）一起忽略掉——v0.2.1 实际踩到过。
# ignore examples/skills/ (the example plugins, which must be committed) — hit in practice in v0.2.1.
backend/skills/
