# ---------- v0.2.1 新增 ----------
# ---------- Added in v0.2.1 ----------
# 开发中的本地插件（放进去即被识别，但不是仓库内容；示例插件在 examples/skills/ 入库）
# Local plugins under development (dropping one in makes it recognized, but it is not repository content; example plugins live in examples/skills/)
backend/skills_dev/
# 本地插件清单（含本机路径与信任状态，因人而异）
# Local plugin registry (holds machine-specific paths and trust state, so it differs from machine to machine)
skills_local.json
# 插件开发日志
# Plugin development log
skills_dev.log
# 自定义自动化模板（用户自己攒的，不入库）
# Custom automation templates (built up by the user, never committed)
automation_templates.json
# 用户外置语言包目录（程序根目录下的 lang\，仅本机临时语言包不入库；
# External language pack directory (lang\ under the program root; only machine-local temporary packs stay out of the repository;
# 必须写 /lang/ 而不是 lang/，否则会把 backend/lang/ 里的内置语言包一起忽略）
# it must be written as /lang/ and not lang/, otherwise the built-in packs under backend/lang/ would be ignored too)
/lang/
# 自动化配置导出件
# Exported automation configuration
*.echodesk-auto

